    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;10.05</strong> Prognostic factors for non-functioning pancreatic neuroendocrine tumours (PanNETs)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Modified from Lloyd RV, Osamura RY, Kloeppel G, Rosai J (Eds): WHO Classification of Tumours of Endocrine Organs (4th edition). IARC: Lyon 2017.",
